<h3 id="third-party">Third-party notices</h3>
<p>This site ships the following third-party software.</p>

<h4>Acornima 1.9.1</h4>
<p>A standard-compliant ECMAScript parser, used by <code>uk.osric.asp.Runtime</code> to check the
JavaScript a stored page serves. It parses and does not execute.</p>
<ul>
    <li>Project: <a href="https://github.com/adams85/acornima">github.com/adams85/acornima</a></li>
    <li>Copyright (c) Adam Simon. All rights reserved.</li>
    <li>Licence: BSD 3-Clause.</li>
</ul>
<p>Acornima is a fork of <a href="https://github.com/sebastienros/esprima-dotnet">Esprima.NET</a>,
copyright (c) Sebastien Ros, distributed under the same BSD 3-Clause licence. It also adopts ideas
from <a href="https://github.com/acornjs/acorn">acorn</a> and
<a href="https://github.com/MatthewSmit/AcornSharp">AcornSharp</a>, both distributed under the MIT
licence.</p>
