<h4>Markdig 1.6.0</h4>
<p>A CommonMark implementation, used by <code>uk.osric.asp.Runtime</code> to render Markdown for
stored pages and for the assistant transcript. It parses and renders; it does not execute
anything.</p>
<ul>
    <li>Project: <a href="https://github.com/xoofx/markdig">github.com/xoofx/markdig</a></li>
    <li>Copyright (c) 2016-2026, Alexandre Mutel. All rights reserved.</li>
    <li>Licence: BSD 2-Clause.</li>
</ul>
